- Current Supabase GoTrue CORS model has three route-registration tiers:
  - Registered well-known/OAuth-router paths reflect arbitrary `Origin` with `ACAC: true` regardless of credentials.
  - Normal `/auth/v1/*` resource paths reflect with `ACAC: true` when an apikey is present; otherwise `ACAO: *` without `ACAC`.
