## Objective
- Continue the authorized OneCode GmbH bug-bounty POC (`bugs.olivermaicher.eu`) in `phase=POC`, `target=api`.
- Produce the mandated evidence-only delta, prioritization, hypotheses, self-critique, one read-only next action, learning, and risk output.

## Important Details
- Scope is limited to `*.onecode.de`, `kurs.onecode.de`, and OneCode-owned infrastructure/cloud APIs, including `aygnpacdkgtsfnhgcyjc.supabase.co` and `aygnpacdkgtsfnhgcyjc.storage.supabase.co`.
- Live verification must be passive-first, `<=1 rps`, and use only read-only `GET`/`HEAD`/`OPTIONS`; no mutation, auth bypass, customer-data access, DoS, lockout, scanner-only, or known-library findings.
- Required output order: DELTA → PRIORITIZE → HYPOTHESES → SELF-CRITIQUE → exactly one NEXT action → LEARNING → RISK.
- Current corrected CORS model supersedes stale entries: GoTrue’s global API-key gate runs before routing; six Kong OAuth/OpenID route names are matched pre-gate and prefix-mounted at arbitrary depth.
- Pre-gate reflecting routes are `/auth/v1/.well-known/jwks.json`, `/auth/v1/.well-known/openid-configuration`, `/auth/v1/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server`, `/auth/v1/oauth/authorize`, `/auth/v1/oauth/token`, and `/auth/v1/oauth/userinfo`; arbitrary and `Origin: null` are reflected with `ACAC: true` without a key.
- Prior “exact-route/closed list” and “CORS tiers” explanations are retracted; do not generalize the finding to storage, edge functions, realtime, or the app origin.
- Use valid 64-hex SHA-256 values: main chunk `f916f314ea61a8c58a055707fc63c251f38e8412ae7a08e6abd7500ec375abca`; sink chunk `5a72d2cd8738ecadfd9ef271f062b3f2ba799617dabddf32987c2883c6dcedd0`; `/login` page `99798c7d94a15abf93ec349b0b221a89dfba756cb21fc581a09d37acd21d9450`.
- Publishable-key bytes hash to `43ccb834cf7f4cbce3e9e4f8365b819cc36909350ab1e68173c1a47675ea034a`; `870cf518...` is the trailing-newline artifact.

## Work State
### Completed
- `kurs.onecode.de` has no deploy since `2026-09-19 11:33Z`; 13 chunk references remain stable. Pre-auth surface is `/login`, `/passwort-vergessen`, `/datenschutz`, `/rechtliches` at 200; `/`, `/admin`, `/courses`, `/dashboard`, `/api/*`, and `/v1/*` redirect 307 to `/login`.
