- **CORS model (corrected):** Three tiers keyed by route registration — (A) registered well-known + OAuth-router paths reflect Origin with `ACAC: true` without apikey (unconditional on those pre-gate routes); (B) `/auth/v1/*` resource paths reflect Origin with `ACAC: true` **only when** the publishable key is present (header or query string), else `ACAO: *` with no `ACAC`; (C) fallthrough/unregistered paths return `ACAO: *` + full 9-method list + `max-age 3600` with no `ACAC`. Preflight does **not** reflect on any tier. Storage plane is plane-level `ACAO: *` with no `ACAC` on all mounted classes.
- **GoTrue pre-gate surface (bounded):** Exactly **7** pre-gate routes (registered ahead of global apikey gate): `.well-known/jwks.json`, `.well-known/openid-configuration`, `.well-known/oauth-authorization-server`, `/auth/v1/oauth/authorize`, `/auth/v1/oauth/token`, `/auth/v1/oauth/userinfo`, `/auth/v1/verify`. `/auth/v1/verify` is exactly-matched (not prefix-mounted); open-redirect branch closed by measurement (off-origin `redirect_to` discarded, falls back to `https://kurs.onecode.de`), residual is a token-state oracle only. OAuth namespace returns `feature_disabled` on all advertised endpoints.
- **Supabase Storage:** Pre-auth bucket-existence oracle confirmed across **10 mounted GET route classes** returning byte-identical `400 {"code":"NoSuchBucket"}` (bucket-resolving subset). 81 candidate bucket names excluded; bucket name unrecoverable from any of the 13 pre-auth chunks. Signed-upload issuer `/storage/v1/object/upload/sign/{bucket}/{key}` bucket-resolves pre-auth (scope note only). S3-compatible plane `aygnpacdkgtsfnhgcyjc.storage.supabase.co/storage/v1/s3` enforces SigV4 and yields **no** bucket/object oracle pre-auth (verification precedes lookup).
