- `kurs`/Supabase stack is hardened: enum, alg-confusion, redirect, desync, middleware-bypass all negative; verify type surface now fully bounded.
- Platform limit: `supabase.co` gateway reflects Origin + `ACAC:true` on pre-gate routes but token model is bearer-only → CORS is informational, not exploitable. Don't re-open.
