- **GoTrue CORS/auth gate (route-registration-ordered)**:
  - (A) registered well-known + OAuth-router paths (`/.well-known/jwks.json`, `/.well-known/openid-configuration`, `/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server`, `/auth/v1/oauth/*`) — reflect `Origin` with `ACAC: true` **unconditionally** (no apikey required); preflight = `ACAO:*` + full method list, **never** reflects `Origin`
