## Objective
- Act as senior bug bounty analyst for OneCode GmbH (report channel: bugs.olivermaicher.eu), running the mandated 8-step analysis loop over a passive-recon knowledge base on scoped assets (`*.onecode.de`, `kurs.onecode.de` + company infra) to surface, prioritize, and validate high-value findings.

## Important Details
- Scope: ONLY `*.onecode.de`, `kurs.onecode.de`, and OneCode GmbH-owned infrastructure/web/apps/APIs/cloud/domains. Report channel: bugs.olivermaicher.eu.
- Phases: `phase=POC`, `target=api`.
- Probing rules: passive-first, ≤1 rps, GET/HEAD/OPTIONS only for live probes; no mutating/auth-bypass tests against live customer data; sha256 any secret; facts vs hypotheses strictly separated; any scanner output needs manual validation.
- Output format: exact 8 steps — [NEW]/[CHANGED]/NO_DELTA → [PRIO] → 3× [HYP] (strict one-field-per-line schema) → [PARKED]/[FINAL] → exactly one [NEXT] → [LEARN] → [RISK].
