- **Scope:** `*.onecode.de`, `kurs.onecode.de` and all company-owned infrastructure/web/APIs/domains operated by OneCode GmbH. Out-of-scope classes per program note (DoS, policy/rate-limit, SPF/DKIM/DMARC, self-XSS, scanner-only, social engineering, etc.).
