| Q6 | Not on always-rejected list? | YES | Not rejected |
| Q7 | Would a reasonable triager accept? | YES | If cross-user access demonstrated |

**Verdict: HOLD** — Needs authenticated testing: enumerate /api/courses/{id}, /enrollments/{id} with test account, attempt cross-user access. Cannot confirm without proof.

---

## Lead 4: GraphQL Introspection on kurs.onecode.de (nemotron3, confidence 45)
| Q | Question | Answer | Reason |
|---|----------|--------|--------|
| Q1 | In scope? | YES | kurs.onecode.de |
| Q2 | Attacker reachable? | YES | Public endpoint (if exists) |
| Q3 | Real security impact? | YES | Schema leak reveals hidden mutations/admin paths |
