| Q3 | Real security impact? | YES | Full subdomain control → phishing/credential harvest |
| Q4 | Provable non-invasively? | PARTIAL | Requires dig CNAME + provider claimability check |
| Q5 | Novel? | MAYBE | Dangling CNAMEs need verification |
