**Verdict: HOLD** — Needs DNS verification: `dig +short CNAME hostmaster.onecode.de`, `dig +short CNAME cto.onecode.de`. If CNAME targets GitHub Pages/Heroku/Railway/S3, check if claimable. Cannot confirm without DNS resolution.

