## Important Details
- In-scope (ONLY): `*.onecode.de`, `kurs.onecode.de`, plus all OneCode-owned infra/domains; out-of-scope classes rejected (DoS, lockout, descriptive errors, OPTIONS/TRACE, CSRF-only, cookie flags on non-sensitive data, TLS best practice, mail config, username enum, etc.).
- Probe rules: passive-first, ≤1 rps, GET/HEAD/OPTIONS only; no auth-bypass or mutating tests vs live customer data.
- Supabase project: `aygnpacdkgtsfnhgcyjc.supabase.co`; publishable key `sb_publishable_g48Bd8qEtLesgk0zgzTRig_eZ6j9w30` → correct sha256 `43ccb834cf7f4cbce3e9e4f8365b819cc36909350ab1e68173c1a47675ea034a` (the KB's `870cf518…` was a line-ending artifact; all PoCs must cite `43ccb834…`).
