- GoTrue CORS: three-tier model — (A) well-known/OAuth-router paths reflect + ACAC unconditionally; (B) `/auth/v1/*` resource paths reflect + ACAC only when apikey present; (C) fallthrough → `ACAO:*` no ACAC. Preflight never reflects. `Bearer`-only origin + kurs CORS-clean caps impact at MEDIUM.
