- CORS model (three tiers keyed on route registration / gate ordering): (A) pre-gate Kong routes (`jwks.json`, `openid-configuration`, `oauth-authorization-server`, `oauth/authorize`, `oauth/token`, `oauth/userinfo`, plus `verify` keyless) reflect Origin with `ACAC: true` regardless of auth state; (B) `/auth/v1/*` resource paths reflect + `ACAC: true` only when apikey present (header or query), else `ACAO: *` no ACAC; (C) unregistered fallthrough → `401 No API key found` + `ACAO: *` no ACAC, full 9-method preflight `max-age 3600`. Preflight NEVER reflects anywhere. GoTrue is Bearer-only (no auth cookie on supabase origin; only `__cf_bm`), so CORS impact is capped MEDIUM. `kurs.onecode.de` emits no cross-origin headers (CORS-clean).
